# Laravel Testing Rules

- Every business-critical rule must have automated coverage.
- Prefer feature/application tests for use cases and state transitions, plus focused unit tests for pure domain logic.
- Test both happy paths and rejected transitions.
- Explicitly test acceptance races/concurrency where practical.
- Test duplicate/idempotent commands.
- Test authorization boundaries for commerce, driver, and admin.
- Test refunds and payout eligibility without relying on live payment providers.
- Use fakes/mocks for external providers and add contract/integration tests where valuable.
- Test offline sync endpoints with duplicated, stale, unauthorized, and conflicting events.
- Test API response/error contracts.
